WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.490
Two fields, side by side.

2
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:07.170
One is farmed intensively, with
synthetic fertiliser and pesticides.

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.070
The other is organic.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:14.010
On organic farms, there are about 30
per cent more species, on average.

5
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:20.150
Meanwhile, the world wasted 1.05
billion tonnes of food in 2022.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.330
So would switching every farm to
organic be better for the planet?

7
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.830
Is organic better in every way?

8
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.330
In this mission, you'll test
food strategies three ways:

9
00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.750
for the environment,
the economy and people.

10
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.630
Then you'll score fair
trade, cutting waste,

11
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.690
organic farming, GM crops and hydroponics,

12
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:41.610
and see which holds up.

13
00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.870
Your mission: decide whether going
all-organic would really be better for the

14
00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.520
planet.
